  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.160` to `4.1.161`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.160...application_builder_helpers/4.1.161)\n\n## What's Changed\n* docs: correct valued-short cluster rule (#699) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/717\n* fix(cli): restore spacing and equals value forms for boolean flags (Fixes #697) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/718\n* Bump Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions and Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/709\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261015103413.837f112...build.20261015160744.9f6e1d6",
